{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BringsSurface.ArchimedeanCondition","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BringsSurface.ArchimedeanCondition","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Defs"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.branch_points_eq_six","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.branch_points_eq_six","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/archimedean-condition.lean#L49-L55","doc":"The number of branch points is 6 when the Euler characteristic is -6.\nBy Riemann-Hurwitz for a degree-d cover of ℙ¹:\nχ = 2d - R_tot, and the branch number is |χ| = 6. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.totalRamification","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.totalRamification","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/archimedean-condition.lean#L45-L47","doc":"The total ramification R_tot = 2d + 6 for a degree-d covering. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.descartes_genus_is_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.descartes_genus_is_four","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/archimedean-condition.lean#L36-L43","doc":"The genus of the base Riemann surface determined by the Descartes\ncondition via the Gauss-Bonnet formula 2 - 2g = χ.\n\nWhen χ = -6: 2 - 2g = -6, so 2g = 8, hence g = 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanCondition.six_invertible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanCondition.six_invertible","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/archimedean-condition.lean#L34-L34","doc":"6 is invertible in R (char(R) ∤ 6). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanCondition.euler_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanCondition.euler_eq","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/archimedean-condition.lean#L32-L32","doc":"The Euler characteristic equals -6. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanCondition.eulerChar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanCondition.eulerChar","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/archimedean-condition.lean#L30-L30","doc":"The categorical Euler characteristic χ(A) = tr(id_A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanCondition.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanCondition.mk","kind":"ctor","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/archimedean-condition.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ArchimedeanCondition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ArchimedeanCondition","kind":"structure","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/archimedean-condition.lean#L19-L34","doc":"**Descartes condition**: a quantum observable universe over `R` satisfies\nthe Descartes condition when the categorical Euler characteristic\nχ(A) = tr(id_A) = -6 and 6 is invertible in R.\n\nThe Euler characteristic determines the topological type of the base\ncurve via 2 - 2g = χ, forcing genus g = 4.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:archimedean-condition}`\nRef: [leitner2026] Chapter 6, §Descartes condition ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:archimedean-condition","label":"def:archimedean-condition","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/archimedean-condition.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}